<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>PathKeeper | Focus & Learning Intelligence System</title>

<style>
:root {
  --cream: #F7F2E8;
  --cream-light: #FFFCF6;
  --cream-dark: #E8DDD0;
  --brown-deep: #3E2723;
  --brown: #5D4037;
  --brown-soft: #8D6E63;
  --blue-deep: #0D1B2A;
  --blue: #1B3A4B;
  --blue-mid: #2C5F7C;
  --blue-soft: #4A7C9B;
  --blue-light: #DCEAF1;
  --gold: #C69B62;
  --green: #54745B;
  --red: #A74638;
  --ink: #263238;
  --muted: #68777B;
  --line: #D9D1C5;
  --white: #FFFFFF;
  --shadow: 0 12px 35px rgba(13,27,42,.07);
}

* {
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
}

html {
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  font-family: Inter, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  line-height: 1.65;
}

button, input, select, textarea {
  font: inherit;
}

button {
  cursor: pointer;
}

button:focus-visible,
input:focus-visible,
select:focus-visible,
textarea:focus-visible,
a:focus-visible {
  outline: 3px solid var(--gold);
  outline-offset: 3px;
}

a {
  color: var(--blue-mid);
}

.page {
  width: min(1500px, 96%);
  margin: auto;
  padding: 22px 0 50px;
}

/* HEADER */

.hero {
  background:
    radial-gradient(circle at 85% 15%, rgba(74,124,155,.3), transparent 32%),
    linear-gradient(125deg, var(--blue-deep), var(--blue));
  color: var(--cream-light);
  border-radius: 22px;
  padding: clamp(28px, 5vw, 65px);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.eyebrow {
  color: var(--gold);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: .76rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  letter-spacing: .17em;
  margin-bottom: 16px;
}

.hero h1 {
  max-width: 1000px;
  font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  line-height: 1.06;
  margin-bottom: 22px;
}

.hero h1 span {
  color: #B8D5E5;
}

.hero p {
  color: #E0E8EC;
  max-width: 850px;
  font-size: 1.08rem;
}

.hero-pills {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 26px;
}

.pill {
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 6px 12px;
  color: var(--cream-light);
  font-size: .78rem;
}

/* NAVIGATION */

.top-nav {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 9px;
  padding: 18px 0 25px;
}

.top-nav a {
  text-decoration: none;
  background: var(--cream-light);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 9px 13px;
  font-size: .83rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--blue-deep);
}

.top-nav a:hover {
  background: var(--blue-light);
}

/* GENERAL LAYOUT */

.section-heading {
  margin: 38px 0 17px;
}

.section-heading .eyebrow {
  margin-bottom: 5px;
}

.section-heading h2 {
  color: var(--brown-deep);
  font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2rem);
}

.section-heading p {
  color: var(--muted);
  max-width: 850px;
  margin-top: 5px;
}

.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}

.card {
  background: var(--cream-light);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 17px;
  padding: 23px;
  min-width: 0;
  box-shadow: var(--shadow);
}

.span-4 { grid-column: span 4; }
.span-5 { grid-column: span 5; }
.span-6 { grid-column: span 6; }
.span-7 { grid-column: span 7; }
.span-8 { grid-column: span 8; }
.span-12 { grid-column: span 12; }

.card h3 {
  color: var(--blue-deep);
  font-size: 1.12rem;
  margin-bottom: 9px;
}

.card h4 {
  color: var(--brown);
  margin-bottom: 7px;
}

.card p {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .93rem;
}

.number {
  display: inline-flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  width: 37px;
  height: 37px;
  background: var(--blue-light);
  color: var(--blue-deep);
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
}

.tag {
  display: inline-block;
  color: var(--brown);
  background: var(--cream-dark);
  border-radius: 30px;
  padding: 4px 9px;
  font-size: .72rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

/* FORMS */

label {
  display: block;
  color: var(--brown);
  font-size: .8rem;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin: 15px 0 6px;
}

input,
select,
textarea {
  width: 100%;
  border: 1px solid #CFC6B9;
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 11px 13px;
  background: var(--white);
  color: var(--ink);
  min-width: 0;
}

textarea {
  min-height: 95px;
  resize: vertical;
}

input:focus,
select:focus,
textarea:focus {
  border-color: var(--blue-soft);
  outline: 2px solid rgba(74,124,155,.16);
}

.hint {
  font-size: .8rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 7px;
}

/* BUTTONS */

.btn {
  display: inline-flex;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 8px;
  border: 0;
  border-radius: 9px;
  padding: 11px 16px;
  font-weight: 800;
  margin-top: 13px;
  transition: filter .2s, transform .2s;
}

.btn:hover {
  filter: brightness(1.08);
  transform: translateY(-1px);
}

.btn-primary {
  background: var(--blue);
  color: white;
}

.btn-secondary {
  background: var(--cream-dark);
  color: var(--brown-deep);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
}

.btn-accent {
  background: var(--gold);
  color: var(--blue-deep);
}

.btn-danger {
  background: #F6E7E3;
  color: var(--red);
}

.btn-outline {
  background: transparent;
  color: var(--blue);
  border: 1px solid var(--blue-soft);
}

.full {
  width: 100%;
}

/* RESULTS */

.result-box {
  background: #EDF3F4;
  border-left: 4px solid var(--blue-mid);
  border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
  padding: 16px;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.result-box p {
  color: var(--ink);
  margin-top: 5px;
}

.result-box ul {
  margin: 9px 0 0 20px;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.result-success {
  background: #EEF3EA;
  border-left-color: var(--green);
}

.result-warning {
  background: #F8F0E3;
  border-left-color: var(--gold);
}

.hidden {
  display: none !important;
}

/* FLOW */

.flow-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(5, minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 18px;
}

.flow-step {
  background: var(--blue-light);
  border-radius: 11px;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
}

.flow-step strong {
  display: block;
  color: var(--blue-deep);
}

.flow-step span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .78rem;
  margin-top: 4px;
}

/* LEARNING STRATEGY */

.action-list {
  list-style: none;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.action-list li {
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 9px 0;
  font-size: .9rem;
  color: var(--ink);
}

.action-list li:last-child {
  border-bottom: 0;
}

.action-list li::before {
  content: "✓";
  color: var(--green);
  font-weight: 900;
  margin-right: 9px;
}

/* FOCUS TIMER */

.timer-card {
  background:
    linear-gradient(145deg, var(--blue-deep), var(--blue));
  color: white;
  border: 1px solid var(--blue-mid);
}

.timer-card h3 {
  color: var(--cream-light);
}

.timer-card p {
  color: #D8E3E8;
}

.timer-label {
  color: var(--gold);
  text-align: center;
  font-size: .75rem;
  font-weight: 900;
  letter-spacing: .14em;
  margin-top: 10px;
}

.clock {
  color: #C5DFEB;
  font-family: monospace;
  font-size: clamp(3rem, 7vw, 5rem);
  font-weight: 900;
  text-align: center;
  letter-spacing: -.08em;
  margin: 15px 0;
  line-height: 1.15;
}

.progress-track {
  width: 100%;
  height: 9px;
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.14);
  border-radius: 20px;
  overflow: hidden;
  margin: 16px 0;
}

.progress-bar {
  height: 100%;
  width: 0%;
  background: var(--gold);
  transition: width .3s;
}

.current-action {
  background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17);
  border-radius: 11px;
  padding: 15px;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.current-action strong {
  display: block;
  color: var(--gold);
  font-size: .72rem;
  letter-spacing: .1em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  margin-bottom: 6px;
}

.current-action span {
  color: white;
  font-weight: 700;
}

.timer-controls {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 9px;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.timer-controls button {
  margin-top: 0;
}

/* METRICS */

.metric-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.metric {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 15px;
  min-width: 0;
}

.metric strong {
  display: block;
  color: var(--blue);
  font-size: 1.8rem;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.metric span {
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .73rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: .06em;
}

/* REVIEW */

.review-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 14px;
  margin-top: 17px;
}

.review-item {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 17px;
}

.review-item h4 {
  color: var(--brown);
}

.review-item p {
  font-size: .82rem;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.review-item.full-review {
  grid-column: span 2;
}

.analysis-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 10px;
  margin-top: 17px;
}

.analysis-box {
  background: var(--blue-light);
  border-radius: 11px;
  padding: 15px;
}

.analysis-box span {
  display: block;
  color: var(--muted);
  font-size: .7rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
}

.analysis-box strong {
  color: var(--blue-deep);
  font-size: 1.5rem;
}

/* HISTORY */

.table-wrap {
  overflow-x: auto;
  margin-top: 15px;
}

.history-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  min-width: 650px;
  font-size: .83rem;
}

.history-table th {
  text-align: left;
  color: var(--brown);
  background: var(--cream);
  padding: 11px;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--line);
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font-size: .7rem;
}

.history-table td {
  padding: 11px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  vertical-align: top;
}

.empty-history {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px dashed var(--line);
  border-radius: 10px;
  padding: 22px;
  text-align: center;
  color: var(--muted);
  margin-top: 12px;
}

/* LEARNING CHART */

.chart {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-end;
  gap: 10px;
  height: 170px;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 12px 4px 0;
  margin-top: 20px;
}

.chart-column {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: flex-end;
  height: 100%;
  gap: 5px;
}

.chart-value {
  font-size: .72rem;
  color: var(--blue-deep);
  font-weight: 800;
}

.chart-bar {
  width: min(42px, 85%);
  min-height: 3px;
  background: var(--blue-soft);
  border-radius: 6px 6px 0 0;
}

.chart-label {
  font-size: .68rem;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-align: center;
  overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

/* LESSONS */

.lesson-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
  gap: 13px;
}

.lesson {
  background: var(--cream);
  border: 1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius: 12px;
  padding: 18px;
}

.lesson .tag {
  color: var(--blue);
  background: var(--blue-light);
}

.lesson h4 {
  color: var(--brown-deep);
  margin-bottom: 7px;
}

.lesson p {
  font-size: .88rem;
}

/* FOOTER */

footer {
  margin-top: 35px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  padding: 25px 10px;
  color: var(--muted);
  text-align: center;
  font-size: .85rem;
}

@media(max-width:1000px) {
  .span-4,
  .span-5,
  .span-6,
  .span-7,
  .span-8 {
    grid-column: span 12;
  }

  .flow-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0,1fr));
  }

  .lesson-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
  }
}

@media(max-width:650px) {
  .page {
    width: 94%;
    padding-top: 12px;
  }

  .card {
    padding: 17px;
  }

  .review-grid,
  .lesson-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .review-item.full-review {
    grid-column: span 1;
  }

  .metric-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
  }

  .analysis-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
  }

  .flow-grid {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0,1fr));
  }

  .timer-controls {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}

@media(max-width:380px) {
  .metric-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }

  .flow-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<div class="page">

<header class="hero">
  <div class="eyebrow">PathKeeper · Focus & Learning Intelligence</div>

  <h1>
    Learn with intention.<br>
    <span>Execute with precision.</span>
  </h1>

  <p>
    A connected learning and performance environment. Identify the skill
    you need to improve, choose an evidence-based practice approach,
    protect your attention, measure what you produce, and adapt your
    next action using the results.
  </p>

  <div class="hero-pills">
    <span class="pill">01 · Define</span>
    <span class="pill">02 · Diagnose</span>
    <span class="pill">03 · Prepare</span>
    <span class="pill">04 · Focus</span>
    <span class="pill">05 · Measure</span>
    <span class="pill">06 · Adapt</span>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="top-nav" aria-label="Main sections">
  <a href="#learning">Learning Plan</a>
  <a href="#practice">Practice Strategy</a>
  <a href="#mission">Mission Setup</a>
  <a href="#focus">Focus Timer</a>
  <a href="#review">Cycle Review</a>
  <a href="#assessment">Assessment</a>
  <a href="#history">Performance History</a>
</nav>

<!-- 01 LEARNING PLAN -->

<div class="section-heading" id="learning">
  <div class="eyebrow">Stage 01 · Define the skill</div>
  <h2>Learning Intelligence Center</h2>
  <p>
    Establish the outcome, identify the skill gap, and measure your
    starting point before choosing how to study or practice.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="grid">

  <section class="card span-7">
    <div class="number">01</div>
    <h3>Goal · Define the desired outcome</h3>
    <p>
      Optimize for durable skill mastery and independent performance,
      not time spent studying or course completion alone.
    </p>

    <label for="learningGoal">Learning goal</label>
    <input id="learningGoal"
      placeholder="Example: Build practical JavaScript skills">

    <label for="skill">Skill to improve</label>
    <input id="skill"
      placeholder="Example: Array manipulation, research, writing">

    <label for="target">Target performance (%)</label>
    <input id="target" type="number" min="1" max="100" value="85">

    <label for="learningDeadline">Target date (optional)</label>
    <input id="learningDeadline" type="date">

    <button class="btn btn-primary full" onclick="createPlan()">
      Analyze learning needs
    </button>

    <div id="planResult" class="result-box hidden" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="card span-5">
    <div class="number">02</div>
    <h3>Sensors · Collect evidence</h3>
    <p>
      Learning needs multiple signals. A single score cannot explain
      every strength, weakness, or obstacle.
    </p>

    <ul class="action-list">
      <li>Accuracy on unfamiliar problems</li>
      <li>Confidence before attempting a task</li>
      <li>Time required to complete a task</li>
      <li>Hints, errors, and repeated mistakes</li>
      <li>Retention after a delay</li>
      <li>Ability to explain and apply the skill</li>
    </ul>

    <p class="hint">
      Confidence is useful context, not proof of mastery.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="card span-6">
    <div class="number">03</div>
    <h3>Baseline · Measure current performance</h3>
    <p>Enter your initial evidence before the intervention.</p>

    <label for="baseline">Baseline accuracy (%)</label>
    <input id="baseline" type="number" min="0" max="100" value="50">

    <label for="confidence">Confidence (1–5)</label>
    <select id="confidence">
      <option value="1">1 — Not confident</option>
      <option value="2">2 — Slightly confident</option>
      <option value="3" selected>3 — Moderately confident</option>
      <option value="4">4 — Confident</option>
      <option value="5">5 — Very confident</option>
    </select>

    <label for="minutes">Available practice time (minutes)</label>
    <input id="minutes" type="number" min="5" max="240" value="25">

    <label for="errorType">Most common difficulty</label>
    <select id="errorType">
      <option value="concept">I don't understand the concept</option>
      <option value="process">I understand but cannot execute it</option>
      <option value="accuracy">I make repeated errors</option>
      <option value="retention">I forget what I learned</option>
      <option value="transfer">I struggle with unfamiliar problems</option>
      <option value="unknown">I'm not sure yet</option>
    </select>
  </section>

  <section class="card span-6">
    <div class="number">04</div>
    <h3>Controller · Choose the next action</h3>
    <p>
      The controller combines baseline performance, confidence,
      reported difficulty, and available time to suggest a practice method.
      Treat the recommendation as a hypothesis to test.
    </p>

    <div id="controllerResult" class="result-box">
      <h4>Waiting for baseline data</h4>
      <p>Complete the baseline fields and analyze your learning needs.</p>
    </div>

    <label for="strategy">Practice strategy</label>
    <select id="strategy">
      <option value="auto">Let PathKeeper recommend</option>
      <option value="teach">Review a worked example</option>
      <option value="guided">Guided practice with hints</option>
      <option value="independent">Independent practice</option>
      <option value="spaced">Spaced retrieval practice</option>
      <option value="transfer">Unfamiliar application challenge</option>
    </select>

    <button class="btn btn-secondary full" onclick="chooseStrategy()">
      Update recommendation
    </button>
  </section>

</div>

<!-- 02 PRACTICE -->

<div class="section-heading" id="practice">
  <div class="eyebrow">Stage 02 · Turn the diagnosis into action</div>
  <h2>Practice Design Center</h2>
  <p>
    Convert the recommendation into a defined activity. The focus timer
    will use this activity as the work target when a learning plan exists.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="grid">

  <section class="card span-7">
    <div class="number">05</div>
    <h3>Actions · Run a practice intervention</h3>
    <p>
      Use the suggested activity as a starting point. Adjust it when
      the task, resources, or available time require a different approach.
    </p>

    <div id="actionPlan" class="result-box">
      <h4>Practice plan</h4>
      <p>Analyze your baseline to generate a targeted practice plan.</p>
    </div>

    <label for="activity">What will you practice?</label>
    <input id="activity"
      placeholder="Example: Solve ten array exercises without copying answers">

    <label for="practiceNotes">What happened during practice?</label>
    <textarea id="practiceNotes"
      placeholder="Record mistakes, hints needed, confusing steps, or breakthroughs."></textarea>

    <button class="btn btn-primary full" onclick="markPracticeComplete()">
      Mark practice complete
    </button>

    <div id="practiceStatus" class="hint" aria-live="polite"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="card span-5">
    <div class="number">06</div>
    <h3>Strategy library · Understand the methods</h3>

    <ul class="action-list">
      <li><strong>Worked example:</strong> Study a complete example and explain each step.</li>
      <li><strong>Guided practice:</strong> Attempt a task with limited hints, then reduce assistance.</li>
      <li><strong>Independent practice:</strong> Solve a new problem without assistance.</li>
      <li><strong>Spaced retrieval:</strong> Recall information after a delay instead of repeatedly rereading.</li>
      <li><strong>Transfer challenge:</strong> Apply the skill to an unfamiliar problem.</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="result-box result-warning">
      <h4>Important distinction</h4>
      <p>
        Finishing a lesson is evidence of activity. Independently
        applying the skill is stronger evidence of capability.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</div>

<!-- 03 MISSION -->

<div class="section-heading" id="mission">
  <div class="eyebrow">Stage 03 · Prepare the environment</div>
  <h2>Mission Architecture</h2>
  <p>
    Define the exact deliverable for the next work session. A clear
    endpoint reduces decision-making during the focus cycle.
  </p>
</div>

<div class="grid">

